  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Education Systems Trial (CREST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiative will draw on best practices in the humanitarian sector toreduce the impact of climate-related crises on schools, school children and communities. CRESTwill do this by connecting community-driven, early-action approaches with parametric climateinsurance to increase the volume and speed of funding available for schools and communitiesaffected by climate-related school closures, ensure continuity of learning and prevent and disruptadverse coping mechanisms impacting children&#x2019;s development and wellbeing and ensurechildren&#x2019;s safe return to school. This will reduce the disruptions to school and the chances of long-term dropout and learning loss. CREST has the capacity to be scaled across multiple contexts,following an initial, successful pilot.</narrative>
  </description>
